WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.660
Here's why you look dark
on video calls.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.080
When a bright window sits behind you,

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.500
your camera may expose for the window
instead of your face.

4
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:13.970
Watch this.

5
00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.530
Turn so the window faces you,
then put the camera in front.

6
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.370
Now the light reaches your face.

7
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.830
Same camera, better position.

8
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.610
Try that before buying a new webcam.
